            "raw": "April 680{{efn|name=fn2|1=Mu'awiya died in the month of [[Rajab]] 60 [[Hijri year|AH]]. Rajab of the year 60 AH started on 7 April 680. The precise date of death varies depending on the source: 7 April according to [[Ibn al-Kalbi]] ({{died-in|819}}), 21 April according to [[al-Waqidi]] ({{died-in|823}}), and 29 April according to [[al-Mada'ini]] ({{died-in|843}}).{{sfn|Morony|1987|page=210}} Yazid acceded to the caliphate a few days after Mu'awiya's death; according to [[Abu Mikhnaf]] ({{died-in|774}}), his accession was on 7 April, whereas [[Elijah of Nisibis]] placed it on 21 April.{{sfn|Wellhausen|1927|p=139}}}}{{snd}}11 November 683",
